   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Prakasam Barrage (Feb 2026):** automated crest-gate telemetry and SCADA were installed at the Prakasam Barrage on the Krishna at Vijayawada."
  },
  {
   "book": 1,
   "row": 170,
   "sec": 2,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Treaty of Bassein (1802) – other terms:** the Peshwa ceded territory yielding about **Rs 26 lakh** a year to pay for the subsidiary force and gave up the city of **Surat** to the British."
  },
  {
   "book": 1,
   "row": 172,
   "sec": 1,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Allahabad High Court:** set up in **1866** (first at Agra, moved to Allahabad in 1869) under the High Courts Act 1861 – after Canning's term ended in 1862."
  }
